<div class="page-wrap"><section class="page-hero"><div class="page-hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--ink)">Compare / Side by side</div><h1 class="page-title">Beda tipis di spek,<br><em>beda jauh di kebutuhan.</em></h1><p class="page-description">Pilih maksimal empat laptop dari katalog. Lihat spesifikasi berdampingan, lalu tentukan kompromi mana yang paling masuk akal.</p></div><aside class="side-note"><strong>Compare protocol</strong>Gunakan tombol “Bandingkan” pada kartu laptop. Pilihan disimpan di browser ini, bukan di akun server.</aside></div></section><section class="section" style="padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:70px"><?php if(count($products)>=2): ?><div class="compare-wrap"><table class="compare-table"><thead><tr><th>Perbandingan</th><?php foreach($products as $p): ?><th class="compare-product"><img src="<?= h(product_image($p['image_path'])) ?>" alt="<?= h($p['name']) ?>" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='assets/images/laptop-placeholder.svg'"><small><?= h($p['brand']) ?> · TIER <?= h($p['tier']) ?></small><h3><?= h($p['name']) ?></h3><a class="text-link" href="detail.php?id=<?= (int)$p['id'] ?>">Lihat detail ↗</a></th><?php endforeach; ?></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($rows as $label=>$field): ?><tr><th><?= h($label) ?></th><?php foreach($products as $p): ?><td><?php if($field==='price'): ?><span class="compare-price"><?= rupiah($p[$field]) ?></span><?php elseif($field==='tier'): ?><span class="tier-badge <?= h(tier_class($p[$field])) ?>" style="position:static">TIER <?= h($p[$field]) ?></span><?php elseif($field==='ram_gb'): ?><?= (int)$p[$field] ?> GB<?php elseif($field==='storage_gb'): ?><?= h($p[$field] ?: '—') ?> GB<?php elseif($field==='weight_kg'): ?><?= h($p[$field] ?: '—') ?><?= $p[$field]?' kg':'' ?><?php else: ?><?= h($p[$field] ?: 'Belum diisi') ?><?php endif; ?></td><?php endforeach; ?></tr><?php endforeach; ?><tr><th>Aksi</th><?php foreach($products as $p): ?><td><a class="button button-dark button-small" href="<?= h($p['tokopedia_url'] ?: setting('tokopedia_url','https://www.tokopedia.com/')) ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored">Cek Tokopedia ↗</a></td><?php endforeach; ?></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="result-footnote">Harga dan spesifikasi berasal dari data yang diinput pengelola. Pastikan kecocokan SKU/varian sebelum transaksi.</p><?php else: ?><div class="empty-state"><strong><?= count($products)===1?'Pilih satu laptop lagi untuk membandingkan.':'Belum ada laptop yang dipilih.' ?></strong><p>Pilih minimal dua kartu di katalog, maksimal empat produk. Daftar pilihan tersimpan di browser yang sama.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="katalog.php">Pilih laptop ↗</a></div><?php endif; ?></section></div>
